OL,3,APolice searching for six men over
OL,4,Aanti-migrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said several police,
OL,7,Fcoastguard and Border Force vehicles
OL,8,Fhad been damaged during the evening.
OL,9,FSeven officers were treated at the
OL,10,Fscene for injuries, but no-one in
OL,11,Fattendance was seriously hurt.
OL,13,FAssistant Chief Constable Tony
OL,14,FRowlinson urged anyone who recognised
OL,15,Fthe six men to contact police.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
