OL,3,ASix dead, 130 missing after Indonesian
OL,4,Aferry capsizes in Java Sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have died and 107 have been
OL,7,Frescued from a capsized Indonesian
OL,8,Fpassenger ferry in the Java Sea,
OL,9,Fauthorities have said.
OL,11,FAnother 130 people are still missing
OL,12,Fafter contact was lost with the Virgo
OL,13,FTransport8 ship, as it encountered bad
OL,14,Fweather.
OL,16,FThe ferry was travelling from Surabaya
OL,17,Fto the South Kalimantan city of
OL,18,FBanjarmasin and was last reported to be
OL,19,Fabout 150km (93 miles) south of
OL,20,FBanjarmasin around 02:00 on Sunday
OL,21,F(18:00 GMT on Saturday).
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
