OL,4,Aon gay bars and homes of LGBTQ+
OL,5,Aactivists
OL,6,
OL,7,FSame-sex marriage is not recognised in
OL,8,FTurkey, with growing pressure on gay
OL,9,Fcouples. Human rights groups in Turkey
OL,10,Fhave accused the government of using
OL,11,Fthe campaign to target the LGBTQ+
OL,12,Fcommunity.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
